            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontsize='9' italic='true'>*Axes </run>
            <run bold='true' fontsize='9' italic='true'>don&apos;t </run>
            <run fontsize='9' italic='true'>start from zero to show change over time</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontsize='9' italic='true'><![CDATA[*New Customers: <4 orders lifetime ]]></run>
            <run bold='true' fontsize='9' italic='true'>and</run>
            <run fontsize='9' italic='true'><![CDATA[ <30 days since their first order]]></run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontsize='9' italic='true'>*Active: Made an order in the last X days (X varies by market, eg: UAE is 52 )</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontsize='9' italic='true'>*Churn and Inactive: Didn&apos;t order within country defined thresholds (varies by market)</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
